WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:05,660
You don’t know how miserable I was last night

2
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,660
Xue Ya and the others made it impossible for me to come out in the middle of the night.

3
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,660
So I came early in the morning to make up for my meal

4
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:10,660
I also brought news

5
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,660
The camp is completely divided

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,660
Zhang Feifei's side

7
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:13,660
Xue Ya's side

8
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,660
We are considered neutral

9
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:15,660
so fast

10
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,660
Xue Ya relies on lighters to control people

11
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:18,660
Zhang Feifei has had enough

12
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,660
Now the fires are separated on both sides

13
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:24,360
Aren't you afraid that there will be more chaos after they split?

14
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:27,360
Chaos is better than a dozen people coming together to rob me.

15
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,580
You are so realistic

16
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,580
If you still treat this place as a holiday variety show

17
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:32,580
Sooner or later, love will be given a destiny

18
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,580
Cooperation can be about emotions

19
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,580
Separate water and medicine when it is dangerous

20
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:37,580
Let’s talk about the rules first

21
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,580
I used to think you had become cold-blooded

22
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,580
look now

23
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,580
It seems like we just haven't adapted to it yet

24
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:43,580
It doesn’t matter if you adapt slowly.

25
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,580
Just don't ask others to tell you the truth.

26
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:48,960
If a desert island is unrealistic, it will be easy to die.
